	//original nugget of truth|lie
	"it's picky about what lettuce it eats|eating diamonds for breakfast"
	"it got straight S's in snail school|cheating at snail school to have better prospects for sponsors" //Ss or S's...
	"it can't sleep without a clean shell|spending upwards of %(L)%(RAND(11) + 1)0,000 a month on shell washes alone"
	"it has a side hustle testing out new paint colors|being paid off to keep quiet about toxic ingredients in some of the shell paints it promotes"
	"it had a crack in its shell repaired once|having had shell surgery to achieve its perfect swirl"
	"it was the biggest snail in its class|eating its biggest rival in snail school years ago"
	"it likes foot massages|demanding to be waited on tentacle and foot 24/7"
	"it dreams of owning a luxury car one day|having a big collection of every kind of car that's ever existed"
